{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-categorical-action-exists","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Proposition","doco:Section"],"label":"prop:categorical-action-exists","kind":"proposition","title":"Existence of the categorical action","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-categorical-action"],"proofs":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prf-categorical-action-exists"],"tags":["existence","categorical-action"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.CategoricalAction.exists","text":"categorical-action-exists.md","leanSource":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-action-exists.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"prop:categorical-action-exists\"></a><p>Let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">(\\mathbf{C}, A, \\tau)</code> be a quantum observable universe and <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\Phi \\in \\mathrm{End}_{\\mathbf{C}}(A)</code> a Lagrangian endomorphism. The categorical action <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathfrak{S}_\\Phi = \\mathrm{ev}_A \\circ (\\mathrm{id}_{A^\\vee} \\otimes \\Phi) \\circ \\mathrm{coev}_A</code> exists as a morphism in <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathbf{C}</code> and equals the categorical trace <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathrm{tr}(\\Phi)</code>.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-action-exists.md","leanStatus":"proved","heading":"Proposition","number":"3.13.2"}
